    "description": "Join another phone's Body to this fleet: that phone runs `caelza-body serve --http` (reached over Tailscale) and this registers it under a name after checking it answers. From then on any tool call naming that device runs on that phone. The token goes into this Body's state dir, never into the registry file.",
